@solidarists
title: NTS-RSDRP Relations
choose-if: ideology = "partydeath"
unavailable-subtitle: Even in this dreamland, the Solidarists are beyond saving.

@conservatives
title: VS-RSDRP Relations
choose-if: ideology = "partydeath"
