@commies
title: RKP-RSDRP Relations

- @maxrelationsrkp
- @increaserelationsrkp
- @lowerrelationsrkp
- @tankrelationsrkp
- @return

@maxrelationsrkp
on-arrival: rkp_relation += 500

Open your eyes, Tovarishch. Return to reality.

@increaserelationsrkp
on-arrival: rkp_relation += 25

Open your eyes, Tovarishch. Return to reality.

@lowerrelationsrkp
on-arrival: rkp_relation -= 25

Open your eyes, Tovarishch. Return to reality.

@tankrelationsrkp
on-arrival: rkp_relation -= 500

Open your eyes, Tovarishch. Return to reality.

